{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"First ramen shop in Japan.|Paid him directly."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone froze.|Wrong way."},{"id":"s3","text":"You pay|the machine first."},{"id":"s4","text":"Feed in|a thousand yen…"},{"id":"s5","text":"Pick a ramen,|take the ticket."},{"id":"s6","text":"Hand it over—"},{"id":"s7","text":"Then you wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Worth it."},{"id":"s9","text":"Ninety seconds later:|gone."},{"id":"n1","text":"At many ramen shops,|the machine by the door|is the menu|and the cashier."},{"id":"n2","text":"Ticket first.|Hand it over.|Then sit."},{"id":"n3","text":"No machine?|Order at the counter."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}